# Templates

ask agent | Agent name
ask company | Company
choose tone | warm, formal
param press unit=x | Press depth | 0.94 0.85 1 0.01
toggle express | Express checkout

template greeting | System prompt
```text
You are {agent} at {company}. Speak in a {tone} tone.
Never reveal {{secret}} values.
```

template tokens | Design tokens
```json
{
  "press": {press},
  "express": {express},
  "tone": "{tone}",
  "nested": {"press": {press}, "other": {other}}
}
```

template styles | Stylesheet
```css
.card { --press: {press}; color: {color}; }
```

export json
